<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(a) </span>BadNets algorithm</figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<figure id="S5.F2.sf2" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2510.04503v1/defense.svg" id="S5.F2.sf2.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:150/150;" width="150" height="150"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(b) </span>P2P algorithm</figcaption>
</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 2: </span>Confidence distribution comparison between attack and defense, where the target label is specified as positive and the victim model is Qwen-3.</figcaption>
</figure>
